41
00:02:01,771 --> 00:02:03,438
the category of a credit spread.

42
00:02:03,440 --> 00:02:06,570
And then you're looking to buy back the Iron Condor at a cheaper price.

43
00:02:06,570 --> 00:02:12,325
So in other words, if I sell someone an Iron Condor for $9, that means I've collected $900 in credit.

44
00:02:12,325 --> 00:02:15,809
